# Ignore everything by default
*

# Track configuration
!.gitignore
!settings.jsonc
!agents/
!agents/**
!commands/
!commands/**
# Skills are deny-by-default, same shape as rules below. The previous
# `!skills/**` was fail-open: a work skill symlinked in from 1Password was
# tracked unless someone remembered to deny it by name, and a new skill
# documenting internal infrastructure became committable silently.
!skills/
skills/*
!skills/1password/
!skills/1password/**
!skills/context7-mcp/
!skills/context7-mcp/**
!skills/gh-cli/
!skills/gh-cli/**
!skills/pdf-generation/
!skills/pdf-generation/**
!skills/python-pro/
!skills/python-pro/**
!skills/security-review/
!skills/security-review/**

# Rules load as global instructions in every session. Generic ones are tracked
# so they exist on a fresh clone; work-specific ones come from 1Password and are
# symlinked in, so anything not named here stays ignored by default.
!rules/
rules/*
!rules/code-comments.md
!rules/context7.md

# Local plugins (in-repo marketplace; runtime install state lives under plugins/)
!local-plugins/
!local-plugins/**

!assets/
!assets/**
